{"id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-representable.md","title":"Numeralwise Definition (Legacy Rep G)","display":"df-representable — Numeralwise Definition (Legacy Rep_G)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-representable","aliases":["92-df-representable"],"display":"df-representable — Numeralwise Definition (Legacy Rep_G)","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-substitution]]"],"source":"第 V 章 pp. 58–59；第 VIII 章 p. 97（PDF 75–76、114）","source_status":"原书 define 的本地一元重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-representable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-representable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-representable — Numeralwise Definition (Legacy Rep_G)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 58–59；第 VIII 章 p. 97（PDF 75–76、114）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书 define 的本地一元重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (capture-avoiding substitution, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (definition-target representability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n(n\\in A\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0))\\land\n(n\\notin A\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0))\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n(n\\in A\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0))\\land\n(n\\notin A\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0))\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}(A)\\)</span> : 集合<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表示</li>\n<li>可表示要求：成员实例可证，非成员实例的否定也可证</li>\n<li>可表达则是标准模型中的语义条件，并同样应使用无捕获代入后的闭句而非把公式当函数应用</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>算术可靠，则可表示蕴含可表达；反向一般不成立</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> 标签与符号，实际语义是原书第 VIII 章的 numeralwise definition：正确正实例与正确负实例分别可证。它不是原书第 V 章 representable 的“成员当且仅当正实例可证”。普通表示见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"9758d74f9a5e939a\" href=\"?note=9758d74f9a5e939a\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-representability\">92-df-smullyan-representability</a>；完全表示的双条件见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e5790b58acf0fb1c\" href=\"?note=e5790b58acf0fb1c\" title=\"92-df-complete-representability\">92-df-complete-representability</a>；一致性把本定义的同一见证提升为完全表示，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"719f56999c0853ae\" href=\"?note=719f56999c0853ae\" title=\"92-lem-definition-complete-representation\">92-lem-definition-complete-representation</a>。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 58–59；第 VIII 章 p. 97（PDF 75–76、114）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ (free-variable function, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Subst}_G$ (capture-avoiding substitution, see [[92-df-substitution]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bar n$ (numeral for $n$, see [[92-df-numeral]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vdash$ (provability relation, see [[92-df-provable]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-representability","status":"resolved","id":"9758d74f9a5e939a","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"沿用 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 标签与符号，实际语义是原书第 VIII 章的 numeralwise definition：正确正实例与正确负实例分别可证。它不是原书第 V 章 representable 的“成员当且仅当正实例可证”。普通表示见[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]；完全表示的双条件见[[92-df-complete-representability]]；一致性把本定义的同一见证提升为完全表示，见[[92-lem-definition-complete-representation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-complete-representability","status":"resolved","id":"e5790b58acf0fb1c","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"沿用 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 标签与符号，实际语义是原书第 VIII 章的 numeralwise definition：正确正实例与正确负实例分别可证。它不是原书第 V 章 representable 的“成员当且仅当正实例可证”。普通表示见[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]；完全表示的双条件见[[92-df-complete-representability]]；一致性把本定义的同一见证提升为完全表示，见[[92-lem-definition-complete-representation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-definition-complete-representation","status":"resolved","id":"719f56999c0853ae","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"沿用 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 标签与符号，实际语义是原书第 VIII 章的 numeralwise definition：正确正实例与正确负实例分别可证。它不是原书第 V 章 representable 的“成员当且仅当正实例可证”。普通表示见[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]；完全表示的双条件见[[92-df-complete-representability]]；一致性把本定义的同一见证提升为完全表示，见[[92-lem-definition-complete-representation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subst}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n(n\\in A\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0))\\land\n(n\\notin A\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0))\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}_G","display":false}],"bytes":2294,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 representable in $S$ 指成员关系恰好对应正实例可证；本库旧 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 指正负数码实例可证，即 proof-theoretic definability。参见[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]、[[92-df-complete-representability]]与[[92-df-representable]]。Normal/Stable 是元语言的可证性封闭性质，见[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]；序数正规函数另属扩展材料。"},{"id":"9758d74f9a5e939a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"非成员条件是“该实例不可证”，而不是“其否定可证”。所以一个 c.e. 但不可判定集合可以在 P.A. 中按此意义可表示。真值集合在定义中完全不出现。原库的 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 采用正负实例的数码可证明条件，应按[[92-df-representable]]的修订说明理解为 numeralwise definition。"},{"id":"27fab6bb26120749","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ (representability predicate in $G$, see [[92-df-representable]])"},{"id":"5d4eae4b8b30ad03","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ (representability predicate in $G$, see [[92-df-representable]])"},{"id":"832d56b1523dc5f9","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ (representability predicate in $G$, see [[92-df-representable]])"},{"id":"cd4abe4b1f57f7bb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f80a790e5ccd9d21","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"893064ec9f8dc7f0","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ (representability predicate in $G$, see [[92-df-representable]])"},{"id":"2d2cf287148220bf","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ (representability predicate in $G$, see [[92-df-representable]])"},{"id":"0b2170bf5b3075ce","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ (representability predicate in $G$, see [[92-df-representable]])"},{"id":"ba2db76478a6200d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)$已在[[92-df-representable]]中用无捕获代入展开为逐个numeral证明正确的正、负实例；本定理不再复制一份易漂移的公式"},{"id":"04751f66804591ae","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ (representability predicate in $G$, see [[92-df-representable]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-representable]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-representable]]"}],"outgoing":["5a1bd470754681a7","b78092e29a02d697","e0eabee5d77258a7","51c43e0240787ebb","b9e3d57e94ce36b7","725c1f1651ce9a00","9758d74f9a5e939a","e5790b58acf0fb1c","719f56999c0